#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:1
msgid "E4218"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `lexscan_pattern_not_anchored`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:5
msgid "A `lexscan` regex pattern is not anchored where anchoring is required."
msgstr "`lexscan` 正则模式没有在要求的位置锚定。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:7
msgid ""
"Patterns used with the `longest` strategy must start at the beginning of "
"the input. Anchor each such regex with `^`."
msgstr "使用 `longest` 策略的模式必须从输入开头开始匹配。请用 `^` 锚定每个此类正则的开头。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:10
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:12
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(input : String) -> String {\n"
"  lexscan input with longest {\n"
"    re\"[a-z]+\" => \"word\"\n"
"    _ => \"other\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:16
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:18
msgid ""
"Add `^` to the start of the regex. Add `$` as well only when the case "
"must consume the whole input."
msgstr "在正则开头添加 `^`。只有当 case 必须消耗整个输入时，才还需要添加 `$`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4218.md:21
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(input : String) -> String {\n"
"  lexscan input with longest {\n"
"    (re\"^[a-z]+\", after=_) => \"word\"\n"
"    _ => \"other\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
